  'Owner brief 2026-11-09. Roles and facts read from the live bank on 2026-11-09 (R10 DVRPC 2005-2008, R09 IBI Group 2008-2011, F02 FHWA national tour-based model, F06 autonomous research system); docs/CAREER-VISIBILITY.md section 3 for the channel limits.',
  'applied by migration; drafts only, nothing posts',
  'draft profile text and one audience-matrix message; public About page and Person record changed by the gateway release',
